# Endpoint the contact form posts to. Static hosting has no backend, so use a
# form service. Any of these work — sign up, create a form, paste the URL here:
#
#   Formspree   https://formspree.io      -> https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
#   Web3Forms   https://web3forms.com     -> https://api.web3forms.com/submit
#   Formspark   https://formspark.io      -> https://submit-form.com/xxxxxxxx
#
# Leave this unset and the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client
# with the enquiry prefilled, which still works but converts less well.
PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=
